      "summary": "Evidence summary: 5 validated structured observations; consult observations and conflicts for supported findings.",
      "observations": [
        {
          "category": "coop",
          "statement": "The central loop is built around two-player ship defense: players coordinate loading and firing cannons, moving between stations, deflecting threats and repairing the vessel, and current feedback describes that role-sharing as a major source of the game's appeal.",
